3764 0 obj
  << /ActualText (How does this connect to social networks\077 \n\nThe forest experiment shows us two things \055 \0501\051 There exists a density after which\054 the fire will propagate from one end to the other\054 no matter how the trees are planted\054 and \0502\051 even when the fire propagates fully\054 some clusters emerge in the final stage unharmed \050they were unreachable from any of the initial positions\051\056 \n\nConnecting to social networks\054 if we were to take Twitter as an example\054 there exists a threshold amount of mutual connections after which an \034opinion\035 will be sure to flow from one point to another \050I am not saying anything about the user adopting the opinion\051\054 and there is a way to moderate\057promote accounts strategically to conserve subspaces so that they are unharmed by the flow of such opinions\056 )
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 3765 0 R
     /Pg 693 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
